    "migraphxPayload": "MIGraphX and provider increments only; no duplicated HIP/HSA/COMGR target paths",
    "reason": "A layered package avoids duplicating the audited HipSharp user-mode closure, but the MIGraphX provider increment and loader-directory contract are not yet packageable.",
